              "type": "adjustLegitimacy",
              "role": "self",
              "delta": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} said in the Senate that powers given for three years have a way of being wanted for a fourth. It was heard in silence. {holder.name} of {holder.house} was in the room."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "keep_counsel",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} voted as the house voted and said nothing on the floor. There will be time to see what {holder.name} does with them."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
